<!--
  Material Symbols "bolt", outlined — DESIGN.md §9.

  The floating action button's mark, and deliberately not a plus. ic_add is the
  header's import control, and two marks that are both a plus opening different
  sets is exactly the ambiguity §6.4 exists to prevent. It is not three dots
  either: ic_more_vert is retired and ScreenChromeTest asserts it stays gone.

  The set it opens is not add-only — Trash is a destination and New Vault is a
  lifecycle action — so a mark that says "add" would be lying about half of it.
  This one says "actions", and the button carries that content description.
-->
